      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently SDK 3.6.1 has UI to remove test avatars, but not for test worlds.\n\nAnd the UI has a delete button only for for each avatar. But it's not good for me because I have a lot of test avatars and need to click buttons many times. I would like to delete them by one-click.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
