  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-10T13:26:09.847Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRChat creation, creators would have many local test avatars and worlds. They consume much storages and will be never used after completion.\n\nSo just having a menu to remove local contents would be nice.\n\n- Remove *.vrca from `%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Avatars` folder.\n\n- Remove *.vrcw from `%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Worlds` folder.",
